WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:01:14.653 --> 00:01:19.653
Subtitles by explosiveskull


00:01:47.549 --> 00:01:49.109
Mom!


00:01:50.709 --> 00:01:51.949
Help!


00:01:51.989 --> 00:01:55.070
Is Tuva here?
Is Tuva here?


00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:57.310
Where is Tuva?


00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:01.350
-Is Tuva here? Where is she?
-I don't know.


00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:03.230
We were going to swim under the jetty.


00:02:11.911 --> 00:02:14.271
Tuva, I'm here


00:02:14.311 --> 00:02:18.112
Cone on. Come on.
Come on, Tuva!


00:02:19.392 --> 00:02:21.312
Come on!


00:02:22.312 --> 00:02:24.952
Come on!
Come on now!


00:02:24.992 --> 00:02:26.752
Tuva...


00:02:27.912 --> 00:02:29.512
Ida, you were supposed
to look after her.


00:02:29.552 --> 00:02:31.713
You were supposed
to look after her!


00:02:33.193 --> 00:02:35.593
If she dies,
you'll be responsible!


00:03:29.557 --> 00:03:30.958
Mom?


00:03:36.278 --> 00:03:40.518
Sweety, it is in the middle of the night.
You have to sleep now.


00:03:40.558 --> 00:03:43.959
-Are you going to swim?
-I'm going to dive.


00:03:44.959 --> 00:03:48.039
-With Tuva and Grandma.
-Will you be wearing socks?


00:03:48.079 --> 00:03:51.239
Of course.
Otherwise my feet will get cold.


00:03:51.279 --> 00:03:53.119
But they're rubber socks.


00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:59.920
When you're older,
you can come too.


00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.240
Where will we live when you
and Dad get divorced?


00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:08.761
-Who says we're getting divorced?
-Eric said so.


00:04:08.801 --> 00:04:11.801
That's why Dad sleeps
in the other room.


00:04:13.121 --> 00:04:15.641
We're not getting divorced.


00:04:16.361 --> 00:04:18.722
Everything will be fine,
I promise.


00:04:51.244 --> 00:04:53.404
Here. What kind of thermo kit
are you wearing?


00:04:53.444 --> 00:04:55.525
A warm one.


00:04:55.565 --> 00:04:57.805
It's 90 degrees in here already.


00:04:57.845 --> 00:05:00.605
You won't need all this
in the Philippines.


00:05:00.645 --> 00:05:04.005
Four months of easy money.
Right?


00:05:05.525 --> 00:05:08.726
You guys are crazy
doing this all winter.


00:05:08.766 --> 00:05:10.486
One last ice bath then!


00:05:27.087 --> 00:05:29.087
<i>Main propeller is okay.</i>


00:05:30.688 --> 00:05:35.448
<i>Small tears on one and three.
Not bad.</i>


00:05:35.488 --> 00:05:37.688
<i>Okay, move to the bow thrusters.</i>


00:05:39.808 --> 00:05:41.769
<i>On my way.</i>


00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:04.410
<i>I'm there.</i>


00:06:12.291 --> 00:06:17.571
<i>-Confirm all engines are stopped.
-Yeah, all engines are stopped.</i>


00:06:19.052 --> 00:06:20.692
<i>Diver in the tube.</i>


00:06:35.613 --> 00:06:37.253
<i>How does it look?</i>


00:06:37.973 --> 00:06:42.534
<i>The usual crap.
Rope, nets...</i>


00:06:44.094 --> 00:06:46.654
<i>It'll take me 15 minutes.</i>


00:06:53.014 --> 00:06:54.815
<i>It's really cold here.</i>


00:06:55.815 --> 00:06:58.415
<i>I should have worn
the other thermo kit.</i>


00:07:00.415 --> 00:07:03.095
<i>Weren't you thinking
you'd be warm?</i>


00:07:03.135 --> 00:07:04.455
<i>In four days time...</i>


00:07:06.496 --> 00:07:09.336
<i>...you'll be doing this yourself.</i>


00:07:25.017 --> 00:07:26.257
<i>Surface?</i>


00:07:26.297 --> 00:07:27.897
Surface.


00:07:27.937 --> 00:07:31.898
<i>The propeller moved.
Does the bridge know I'm here?</i>


00:07:31.938 --> 00:07:34.938
<i>-Is it the current doing anything?
-There's no damn current here!</i>


00:07:34.978 --> 00:07:39.058
<i>The propeller moved.
It was mechanical.</i>


00:07:39.098 --> 00:07:41.819
<i>Engine running!
Engine running!</i>


00:08:16.661 --> 00:08:17.501
Tuva!


00:08:20.462 --> 00:08:23.342
-Stop it!
-Let me go!


00:08:23.382 --> 00:08:24.822
It's nobody's fault!


00:08:26.862 --> 00:08:29.903
Tuva! Tuva!


00:08:29.942 --> 00:08:31.223
-Let me go!
-Tuva!


00:08:52.104 --> 00:08:52.984
Ida!


00:08:55.225 --> 00:08:58.225
-Hi.
-Hi!


00:08:58.265 --> 00:08:59.665
Early start?


00:08:59.705 --> 00:09:01.945
Not when you have kids.


00:09:01.985 --> 00:09:04.185
What's with your hand?


00:09:05.345 --> 00:09:06.426
It's nothing.


00:09:06.466 --> 00:09:08.866
We'll get your bags.
Mom's waiting.


00:09:12.386 --> 00:09:13.786
Mom!


00:09:15.706 --> 00:09:17.186
Hi, Tuva!


00:09:18.787 --> 00:09:20.227
Hi!


00:09:31.908 --> 00:09:34.108
-Hi, Ida!
-Hi.


00:09:37.788 --> 00:09:39.468
Hi, darling!


00:09:42.189 --> 00:09:44.269
You have to come
visit me more often.


00:09:46.109 --> 00:09:47.749
Knut! Knut!


00:09:48.749 --> 00:09:50.029
Knut!


00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:03.750
So nice to have
both of you here for once.


00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:06.751
We'll spend the weekend together,


00:10:06.991 --> 00:10:09.151
go diving--
be out in nature,


00:10:09.191 --> 00:10:12.511
allow the mind to relax...


00:10:17.151 --> 00:10:19.472
How are the kids, Ida?


00:10:19.512 --> 00:10:22.872
Good. They're getting older.


00:10:24.352 --> 00:10:25.272
And Einar?


00:10:26.592 --> 00:10:28.392
It...


00:10:28.432 --> 00:10:30.233
It's good.
We're in counseling.


00:10:31.233 --> 00:10:33.633
Is that something
your father suggested?


00:10:33.673 --> 00:10:36.713
I'm asking because
that's what he always wanted for us.


00:10:36.753 --> 00:10:38.913
Therapy, therapy...
Until the end of time.


00:10:38.953 --> 00:10:42.034
God, You can't sit in a room
and talk yourself into loving someone.


00:10:42.074 --> 00:10:44.914
It's either there or it isn't!
And if it isn't there...


00:10:44.954 --> 00:10:48.434
Ida, don't be like your father,
just letting things fall apart.


00:10:48.474 --> 00:10:50.154
We'll keep up the therapy.


00:10:50.194 --> 00:10:52.514
No one will come and help you,
if that's what you think.


00:10:52.554 --> 00:10:54.035
Who would that be?


00:10:54.075 --> 00:10:56.595
And don't tell me
you're doing it for the kids.


00:10:59.355 --> 00:11:02.115
Ida, I don't want to fight with you.


00:11:02.155 --> 00:11:05.676
I'm sorry.
I didn't mean it to be like this.


00:11:08.596 --> 00:11:10.916
You can't go diving with that cough.


00:11:11.916 --> 00:11:13.996
A cup of tea
and some sleep will fix it.


00:11:14.516 --> 00:11:16.596
And we'll make it a quiet evening.


00:11:41.399 --> 00:11:43.199
Why are you knocking?


00:11:51.639 --> 00:11:53.239
What's up?


00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.680
In the car today...


00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:59.640
Well, she can't take her medicine
before diving.


00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:02.040
Without it, she goes a little...


00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:04.560
Never mind.


00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:08.601
-You're much better with her than I am.
-More practice maybe...


00:12:11.161 --> 00:12:13.121
Don't let it get to you.


00:12:17.482 --> 00:12:20.202
I was thinking, after the dive,


00:12:20.242 --> 00:12:24.282
maybe you could
come back with me to Sweden.


00:12:26.242 --> 00:12:28.882
The kids, they really miss you.


00:12:28.922 --> 00:12:31.803
I'm... I'm going to the Philippines
on Tuesday.


00:12:34.403 --> 00:12:36.363
-Another time.
-But...


00:12:36.403 --> 00:12:37.403
Good night.


00:12:39.963 --> 00:12:40.963
Good night.


00:12:43.564 --> 00:12:44.764
...beginning of the day.


00:12:44.804 --> 00:12:47.124
Later on rain or snow
with poor visibility.


00:12:47.164 --> 00:12:50.284
Minus five degrees...


00:13:02.805 --> 00:13:05.526
A hot bath is all she's diving into today.


00:13:27.767 --> 00:13:29.968
What the hell are you doing?


00:13:30.608 --> 00:13:33.448
Mom will lose it
if she finds out I'm smoking.


00:13:35.808 --> 00:13:40.008
-How long have you been doing that?
-This is the second dog.


00:13:43.809 --> 00:13:45.249
Wanna go?


00:14:35.853 --> 00:14:37.053
Hey!


00:14:39.413 --> 00:14:40.653
Wake up.


00:14:41.894 --> 00:14:43.454
Look.


00:14:44.854 --> 00:14:46.294
-Hello.
-Hi.


00:14:46.334 --> 00:14:50.654
-Flat tire?
-Yes, but a tow truck is on the way.


00:14:50.694 --> 00:14:55.055
-Do you have a spare?
-The tow truck will be here any time now.


00:14:55.935 --> 00:14:59.935
-We can't leave you with a flat tire.
-No, but they're on the way.


00:15:02.095 --> 00:15:03.175
Could you open this?


00:15:03.215 --> 00:15:05.536
But, Tuva,
she wants to wait.


00:15:06.936 --> 00:15:08.176
Magic!


00:15:10.336 --> 00:15:11.496
Yup...


00:15:12.936 --> 00:15:14.256
Hi there.


00:15:18.457 --> 00:15:22.457
-Are you friends?
-Sisters.


00:15:25.017 --> 00:15:27.057
Or half-sisters...


00:15:27.097 --> 00:15:30.338
Mom liked to go
on diving trips alone.


00:15:35.098 --> 00:15:37.578
Tuva, you can stop now.
They're here.


00:15:43.139 --> 00:15:44.699
Damn it.


00:16:09.741 --> 00:16:10.941
Come on, Knut.


00:16:15.181 --> 00:16:17.102
This feels familiar.


00:16:17.142 --> 00:16:20.382
From what I remember,
mom parked down there.


00:16:21.942 --> 00:16:25.262
Yup, it seems you and mom
do a lot of things together


00:16:26.262 --> 00:16:28.142
Are you pouting or diving?


00:16:30.703 --> 00:16:31.743
Here.


00:16:34.903 --> 00:16:36.263
Knut!


00:16:38.063 --> 00:16:41.344
The company overstocks
these and nobody takes inventory.


00:16:42.424 --> 00:16:43.624
Did you steal them?


00:16:46.064 --> 00:16:47.544
Wireless communication.


00:16:48.544 --> 00:16:51.144
It's been a while
since I did full mask...


00:16:51.184 --> 00:16:52.224
Come on, grumpy.


00:16:53.385 --> 00:16:54.905
It's easy.


00:16:56.465 --> 00:16:57.465
Knut!


00:16:59.705 --> 00:17:01.385
Come here. Sit.


00:17:01.784 --> 00:17:02.825
Sit.


00:17:21.587 --> 00:17:22.667
Come here.


00:17:23.667 --> 00:17:25.747
Knut, come here.


00:17:26.747 --> 00:17:29.788
Hey, where's your phone?
Check the battery and reception.


00:17:29.828 --> 00:17:33.908
I have 80% battery power
and three bars.


00:17:35.428 --> 00:17:37.228
Okay, we have a satellite phone too.


00:17:38.788 --> 00:17:40.508
Shit!


00:17:45.829 --> 00:17:49.269
We'd better move our gear
under the overhang.


00:17:50.269 --> 00:17:51.429
Yes...


00:18:17.272 --> 00:18:19.872
Okay, 46 feet straight down here,


00:18:19.912 --> 00:18:23.312
around the point
is the entry to the swim-through.


00:18:27.552 --> 00:18:29.313
This should be open.


00:18:30.353 --> 00:18:33.273
The swim-through ascends to 16 feet.


00:18:33.313 --> 00:18:35.513
That's our safety stop.


00:18:35.553 --> 00:18:37.513
-Okay?
-Okay.


00:18:41.034 --> 00:18:42.754
<i>Diver One connected.</i>


00:18:44.474 --> 00:18:46.314
If something goes south...


00:19:00.675 --> 00:19:02.675
<i>Ida, are you with me?</i>


00:19:03.795 --> 00:19:05.236
<i>Yes, coming.</i>


00:19:09.876 --> 00:19:12.036
<i>This is a little scary.</i>


00:19:13.676 --> 00:19:15.196
<i>Don't worry.</i>


00:19:16.957 --> 00:19:19.797
<i>It'll open up further on.</i>


00:19:19.837 --> 00:19:22.477
<i>One tight spot,
then it gets wider.</i>


00:19:23.797 --> 00:19:26.117
<i>Tuva, wait,
let me catch up.</i>


00:19:26.837 --> 00:19:30.518
<i>This is exactly
where mom and I were.</i>


00:19:35.998 --> 00:19:37.638
<i>Just a little further.</i>


00:19:41.639 --> 00:19:43.119
<i>Tight spot...</i>


00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:00.720
<i>Okay, this is it.</i>


00:20:05.841 --> 00:20:07.921
<i>Stop here.
I want to show you something.</i>


00:20:13.361 --> 00:20:15.401
<i>Release some air.</i>


00:20:17.642 --> 00:20:18.802
<i>Why?</i>


00:20:20.042 --> 00:20:23.362
<i>Why do you always
have to be so difficult. Just...</i>


00:20:23.402 --> 00:20:26.202
<i>Stop! Get off my stuff!</i>


00:20:26.242 --> 00:20:28.242
<i>Do what I say,
release some air.</i>


00:20:43.604 --> 00:20:45.964
<i>Good. That's enough.
Come on.</i>


00:20:55.525 --> 00:20:59.005
<i>Don't breathe here.
You'll get CO2 poisoning!</i>


00:20:59.045 --> 00:21:02.725
Relax. It's like a dive bell.
We can be here for a little while.


00:21:08.566 --> 00:21:09.446
Check this out.


00:21:10.966 --> 00:21:13.286
Mom ruined my diver's knife doing this.


00:21:14.766 --> 00:21:17.927
It was the first thing
I ever bought with my own money.


00:21:19.087 --> 00:21:20.447
I loved that knife.


00:21:22.767 --> 00:21:23.967
What is it?


00:21:25.167 --> 00:21:28.928
-Nothing.
-Stop mumbling and pouting!


00:21:29.888 --> 00:21:32.688
It's so fucking obvious
that you and mom shared so much


00:21:32.728 --> 00:21:34.208
and I was never allowed in.


00:21:34.248 --> 00:21:37.888
-It's even carved in stone.
-Oh give it up, Ida, will you?


00:21:37.928 --> 00:21:41.249
-Did I choose that? Is it my fault?
-No, but you know what?


00:21:41.289 --> 00:21:43.769
No, but you know what?
This is what happens


00:21:43.809 --> 00:21:45.929
when parents split up
and people take sides.


00:21:45.969 --> 00:21:48.409
Just like what's about to happen
to my family.


00:21:48.449 --> 00:21:51.609
And there's not a goddamn thing
I can do about it!


00:21:51.649 --> 00:21:53.850
-Get it? It's happening again!
-Stop it! Stop.


00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:58.450
What's going on?


00:22:00.490 --> 00:22:02.050
You said things were going well.


00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:05.891
It's not good at all.


00:22:10.251 --> 00:22:11.731
I'm cold.


00:22:16.371 --> 00:22:17.212
Ida...


00:22:45.134 --> 00:22:46.814
<i>How much air do you have left?</i>


00:22:51.094 --> 00:22:52.094
<i>Twelve bars.</i>


00:22:53.695 --> 00:22:57.775
<i>-That's a bit low. Are you cold?
-Of course I'm cold.</i>


00:22:57.815 --> 00:23:00.975
<i>Three minutes safety stop,
then we go up.</i>


00:23:02.775 --> 00:23:04.736
<i>Ida, look!</i>


00:23:04.776 --> 00:23:06.136
<i>Wow!</i>


00:23:07.216 --> 00:23:09.616
<i>They're not dangerous,
just curious.</i>


00:23:12.136 --> 00:23:14.296
<i>Answer them.
They're talking to you.</i>


00:23:23.937 --> 00:23:26.737
<i>-What happened? Why did they leave?
-You never know...</i>


00:23:26.777 --> 00:23:28.097
<i>Watch out!</i>


00:23:28.858 --> 00:23:30.178
<i>Damn it!</i>


00:23:30.218 --> 00:23:32.218
<i>Are you all right?
That hurt!</i>


00:23:32.258 --> 00:23:34.818
<i>Screw the safety stop.
Let's go up.</i>


00:23:34.858 --> 00:23:36.218
<i>Tuva!</i>


00:23:37.698 --> 00:23:39.338
<i>Tuva!</i>


00:23:39.378 --> 00:23:40.378
<i>Tuva!</i>


00:23:41.379 --> 00:23:43.019
<i>Get back, get back.
Get back!</i>


00:23:50.739 --> 00:23:52.459
<i>Tuva! Tuva!</i>


00:23:55.700 --> 00:23:57.260
<i>I'm coming, Tuva!</i>


00:24:02.060 --> 00:24:03.300
<i>Tuva!</i>


00:24:08.421 --> 00:24:09.341
<i>Tuva!</i>


00:24:11.901 --> 00:24:13.901
<i>I'm stuck!
I'm stuck!</i>


00:24:13.941 --> 00:24:17.582
<i>Shine your flashlight.
I need to see where you are!</i>


00:24:17.622 --> 00:24:19.822
<i>Shine your light up.
Ida, stop.</i>


00:24:19.862 --> 00:24:22.982
<i>I can't see you!
Shut up!</i>


00:24:23.022 --> 00:24:25.982
<i>We need to keep calm now.
Understand?</i>


00:24:26.022 --> 00:24:28.663
<i>Okay.
What's your depth?</i>


00:24:32.263 --> 00:24:35.823
-72 feet.
-Okay, listen.


00:24:36.783 --> 00:24:41.424
<i>I'm stuck.
Keep calm, save your air.</i>


00:24:41.464 --> 00:24:43.824
<i>-Get to the bottom.
-Okay.</i>


00:24:45.304 --> 00:24:47.104
<i>Okay.</i>


00:24:47.144 --> 00:24:49.864
<i>One thing at a time now.</i>


00:24:49.904 --> 00:24:53.905
<i>Right now you just need
to get to the bottom.</i>


00:24:55.025 --> 00:24:58.745
<i>Just keep going.
Close to the wall I think.</i>


00:25:02.545 --> 00:25:06.506
<i>I'm down.
Good. What's your depth?</i>


00:25:09.666 --> 00:25:13.786
<i>108 feet!
Tuva, we have to get out of here.</i>


00:25:13.826 --> 00:25:19.707
<i>Don't worry, there are margins.
Shine your flashlight, 360 degrees.</i>


00:25:22.267 --> 00:25:24.507
<i>Where?
Can you see me?</i>


00:25:24.547 --> 00:25:30.508
<i>No. The line for your marker-buoy
is in your leg pocket.</i>


00:25:31.508 --> 00:25:34.748
<i>Yeah, I think so...
I have it.</i>


00:25:35.908 --> 00:25:38.348
<i>Tie it to something where you are.</i>


00:25:38.388 --> 00:25:40.228
<i>Ida, we have to work fast.</i>


00:25:40.268 --> 00:25:43.629
<i>You need to find me
before you run out of air.</i>


00:25:43.669 --> 00:25:46.029
<i>Okay.
Swim 66 feet.</i>


00:25:46.069 --> 00:25:49.469
<i>In what direction?
It doesn't matter. Left.</i>


00:25:51.629 --> 00:25:55.110
<i>Tuva, can't you get out?</i>


00:25:55.150 --> 00:25:59.430
<i>No, I'm completely stuck, but I'm lucky.
I could have been crushed.</i>


00:25:59.470 --> 00:26:03.270
<i>Tuva, you have to try to get out.</i>


00:26:08.311 --> 00:26:14.431
<i>It's impossible.
I swam 66 feet. I can't...</i>


00:26:14.471 --> 00:26:17.952
<i>-I can't see you.
-Okay, turn around.</i>


00:26:17.992 --> 00:26:20.232
<i>-Tie the line off.
-Yes.</i>


00:26:20.272 --> 00:26:23.752
<i>Don't get lost now.
You have to be quick.</i>


00:26:23.792 --> 00:26:27.392
<i>I can't be far away now.
Keep going.</i>


00:26:28.553 --> 00:26:30.673
<i>Tuva, I can't see anything.</i>


00:26:32.153 --> 00:26:37.113
<i>-There are just rocks everywhere.
-How much air do you have?</i>


00:26:37.153 --> 00:26:42.034
<i>-35 bars. I'm almost out.
-Okay... Easy.</i>


00:26:42.674 --> 00:26:46.634
<i>Breathe slowly.
Save your air.</i>


00:26:46.674 --> 00:26:49.634
<i>You have to find me
before it runs out.</i>


00:26:49.674 --> 00:26:50.634
<i>Okay.</i>


00:26:57.235 --> 00:26:58.795
<i>Ida!</i>


00:26:58.835 --> 00:27:01.635
<i>Ida, I can see the light
from your flashlight. Keep going!</i>


00:27:03.595 --> 00:27:05.836
<i>There!
There you are!</i>


00:27:05.876 --> 00:27:08.476
<i>I can see you, Ida.</i>


00:27:08.516 --> 00:27:11.156
<i>-Take it easy now!
-No, no, no, no!</i>


00:27:11.916 --> 00:27:14.916
<i>-Oh my God!
-Ida! Ida, listen to me!</i>


00:27:14.956 --> 00:27:17.437
<i>We have to move
the rock out of the way.</i>


00:27:18.077 --> 00:27:23.397
<i>Ida, stop it! Listen to me!
The rock won't budge.</i>


00:27:23.437 --> 00:27:26.357
<i>-We have to move it.
-Take it easy.</i>


00:27:27.237 --> 00:27:29.118
<i>Take it easy!</i>


00:27:29.158 --> 00:27:32.518
<i>We have to get you out, Tuva!
Push! Push!</i>


00:27:32.558 --> 00:27:35.438
<i>Listen to me, you can't move it!</i>


00:27:35.478 --> 00:27:38.758
<i>Easy, just go easy.</i>


00:27:38.798 --> 00:27:43.839
<i>Ida, hold it together.
We have things to do here.</i>


00:27:43.879 --> 00:27:46.839
<i>We have to get you out.
We have to get you out, Tuva!</i>


00:27:46.879 --> 00:27:50.039
<i>-One thing at a time. Okay?
-Okay.</i>


00:27:50.079 --> 00:27:52.840
<i>You'll find glow sticks
in my leg pocket.</i>


00:27:54.120 --> 00:27:56.880
<i>You need to mark this spot.</i>


00:27:56.920 --> 00:27:59.360
<i>Then go up to the surface
and call for help.</i>


00:27:59.400 --> 00:28:02.920
<i>Then make one more dive
and bring me extra air.</i>


00:28:02.960 --> 00:28:06.001
<i>There are two tanks at base.</i>


00:28:07.121 --> 00:28:11.081
<i>Attach the line to the marker buoy
and secure it close to me.</i>


00:28:11.121 --> 00:28:12.041
<i>Okay.</i>


00:28:15.521 --> 00:28:18.442
<i>Fill the buoy with air
so that it floats to the surface.</i>


00:28:19.202 --> 00:28:23.482
<i>Do a direct ascent immediately.
No safety stop.</i>


00:28:23.522 --> 00:28:26.002
<i>When you're up just call for help.</i>


00:28:27.122 --> 00:28:28.603
<i>-Ida?
-Yes.</i>


00:28:28.643 --> 00:28:33.443
<i>You can do this.
All you need to do is call for help.</i>


00:28:33.483 --> 00:28:38.683
<i>I'll be fine.
To the surface now. Go!</i>


00:28:53.165 --> 00:28:58.445
<i>Ida, your dive computer will tell you
to do a safety stop.</i>


00:28:58.485 --> 00:29:02.205
<i>-Just ignore it, there are margins.
-There's the alarm!</i>


00:29:04.165 --> 00:29:08.686
<i>Ignore it. You can do a longer stop
on the next dive.</i>


00:29:08.726 --> 00:29:12.806
<i>Get up there and call for help. Now!
Everything will be fine.</i>


00:29:13.526 --> 00:29:16.006
<i>Okay, I'm going up.</i>


00:29:47.969 --> 00:29:49.009
<i>Okay.</i>


00:30:00.610 --> 00:30:03.290
No, no, no... Fuck!


00:30:44.814 --> 00:30:49.534
The rock slide struck up here too.
Phones, air-- it's all destroyed.


00:30:49.574 --> 00:30:53.015
<i>-Can you move the rock?
-You don't get it. Everything's gone.</i>


00:30:53.055 --> 00:30:53.975
Tuva!


00:30:54.015 --> 00:30:56.855
<i>Go to the car.
There are two air tanks in the car.</i>


00:30:56.895 --> 00:30:59.975
But the car keys are under the rock!
What do I do?


00:31:00.015 --> 00:31:02.095
<i>Just smash a window!</i>


00:31:02.135 --> 00:31:06.376
<i>The trunk.
Get the car jack from the trunk!</i>


00:31:06.416 --> 00:31:09.496
<i>Ida, set your timer for 15 minutes.</i>


00:31:09.536 --> 00:31:13.896
<i>You can use the car jack
to lift the rock. Go, now!</i>


00:32:17.182 --> 00:32:19.942
The trunk, the trunk, the trunk...


00:32:23.702 --> 00:32:24.942
What...


00:32:26.702 --> 00:32:29.463
Trunk... no, no, no!
Damn it!


00:32:30.463 --> 00:32:31.423
No...


00:32:31.463 --> 00:32:33.783
God damn it!


00:32:35.023 --> 00:32:36.383
Fuck! Fuck!


00:32:43.504 --> 00:32:45.184
Oh my God!


00:34:20.112 --> 00:34:22.072
Help!


00:34:24.592 --> 00:34:28.593
Help!


00:34:43.554 --> 00:34:45.714
House, house...
There.


00:34:46.874 --> 00:34:49.314
There... One mile.


00:35:16.197 --> 00:35:19.357
<i>-Tuva, I'm here.
-Do you have the stuff?</i>


00:35:19.397 --> 00:35:22.077
Not the car jack.
I couldn't get into the trunk.


00:35:22.117 --> 00:35:25.157
<i>What about the air?
Do you have it?</i>


00:35:30.518 --> 00:35:31.678
Help!


00:36:22.962 --> 00:36:25.722
<i>-Tuva!
-Ida, what are you doing?</i>


00:36:25.762 --> 00:36:29.523
<i>-I'm almost out of air!
-Tuva, there was an airplane!</i>


00:36:30.603 --> 00:36:33.563
<i>There was an airplane!
I don't know if it saw me.</i>


00:36:33.603 --> 00:36:35.683
<i>Ida, you have to get down.</i>


00:36:35.723 --> 00:36:38.323
<i>-I'm almost out of air.
-The airplane!</i>


00:36:39.403 --> 00:36:41.404
<i>It´s back!</i>


00:36:41.444 --> 00:36:45.084
<i>Damn it! The emergency flare!
Light your emergency flare!</i>


00:36:45.124 --> 00:36:48.004
<i>I don't have it.
I used it already.</i>


00:36:48.804 --> 00:36:53.485
<i>Listen! My air gauge is at zero.
I'm out of air any second.</i>


00:36:53.525 --> 00:36:56.285
<i>Tuva, the airplane is turning.
It spotted me!</i>


00:36:58.605 --> 00:37:00.005
<i>Tuva!</i>


00:37:00.045 --> 00:37:04.206
<i>Diver disconnected.
Tuva! 30 seconds. I'm coming!</i>


00:37:11.926 --> 00:37:13.446
<i>Tuva! I'm coming!</i>


00:37:14.206 --> 00:37:17.087
<i>Can you hear me?
Hold on, Tuva! I'm almost there.</i>


00:37:34.768 --> 00:37:36.448
<i>Okay?</i>


00:37:42.529 --> 00:37:46.249
<i>I dropped the other air tank
when I signaled the airplane.</i>


00:37:46.289 --> 00:37:48.289
<i>I have to find it.</i>


00:37:49.089 --> 00:37:52.570
<i>I'll leave my air with you.
Okay?</i>


00:40:34.063 --> 00:40:37.903
<i>I couldn't find the way back.
I couldn't find you...</i>


00:40:43.184 --> 00:40:45.984
<i>I'll hook your mask up
to the new air tank.</i>


00:40:46.984 --> 00:40:50.904
<i>We have to hurry.
The airplane is up there.</i>


00:40:54.465 --> 00:40:55.785
<i>It works.</i>


00:41:02.305 --> 00:41:05.466
<i>Tuva, the airplane is up there.</i>


00:41:05.506 --> 00:41:07.266
<i>It saw me when I was in the water.</i>


00:41:07.306 --> 00:41:09.746
<i>I have to get back up there again.
Tuva, we have to hurry.</i>


00:41:09.786 --> 00:41:12.626
<i>Okay, up now!
Go!</i>


00:41:13.426 --> 00:41:15.186
<i>Up!</i>


00:41:16.947 --> 00:41:21.267
<i>Ida, this time you have to
do a safety stop.</i>


00:41:21.307 --> 00:41:25.147
<i>Why?
I was only down for a few minutes.</i>


00:41:25.187 --> 00:41:29.668
<i>Tuva, I have to get up to the airplane
before it leaves.</i>


00:41:29.708 --> 00:41:30.828
<i>We can't wait.</i>


00:41:30.868 --> 00:41:33.308
<i>No, you have to stop at 10 feet.</i>


00:41:33.348 --> 00:41:38.348
<i>Okay, I'm at 10 feet.
How long do I have to stop for?</i>


00:41:38.388 --> 00:41:41.989
<i>Damn it, this is way off the charts...
I don't know.</i>


00:41:42.029 --> 00:41:44.149
<i>The airplane is up there.</i>


00:41:44.189 --> 00:41:48.069
<i>Ida, I don't know what will happen
if you don't stop.</i>


00:41:48.109 --> 00:41:51.469
<i>You said there were margins.
I have to get up there now!</i>


00:41:51.509 --> 00:41:53.230
<i>Ida! Stop!</i>


00:41:54.870 --> 00:41:58.030
<i>-No, no, no, no!
-What is it?</i>


00:41:58.070 --> 00:42:01.910
<i>Damn it!
The airplane is gone.</i>


00:42:01.950 --> 00:42:03.390
<i>What do we do now?</i>


00:42:04.871 --> 00:42:08.031
<i>Tuva?
Tuva, what do we do now?</i>


00:42:08.071 --> 00:42:11.071
<i>You need to go back to the car
and get the jack.</i>


00:42:12.031 --> 00:42:15.832
<i>I can't get into the trunk.
But there's a house on the map.</i>


00:42:15.872 --> 00:42:19.912
<i>No, you have to lift the rock
with the car jack.</i>


00:42:19.952 --> 00:42:23.672
<i>No! The The house is better.
I can get help.</i>


00:42:23.712 --> 00:42:29.753
<i>Ida, no one is coming to help us.
Get the jack from the car.</i>


00:42:29.793 --> 00:42:30.953
<i>Okay.</i>


00:43:50.159 --> 00:43:53.080
Shut up, Knut!


00:43:54.840 --> 00:43:56.440
Shut up!


00:45:01.645 --> 00:45:03.045
Hello?


00:45:06.766 --> 00:45:08.046
Hello?


00:45:39.929 --> 00:45:41.209
Damn.


00:45:58.170 --> 00:45:59.450
Doggy?


00:46:03.931 --> 00:46:07.611
Hey, buddy!
Easy now. Easy!


00:46:10.451 --> 00:46:12.131
Easy...


00:46:43.454 --> 00:46:44.774
Fuck!


00:46:48.374 --> 00:46:50.454
Oh, no! My suit...


00:47:29.378 --> 00:47:31.258
Skype, Skype, Skype...


00:47:32.698 --> 00:47:34.058
Skype.


00:47:35.258 --> 00:47:37.258
Connect to Eyvind's mobile.


00:47:40.419 --> 00:47:43.379
Connect.
Eyvind's mobile.


00:47:48.579 --> 00:47:51.219
God damn it!


00:47:51.259 --> 00:47:52.540
Damn!


00:48:31.423 --> 00:48:33.703
Cheap-ass Norwegians.


00:49:22.747 --> 00:49:24.747
Where the hell is the jack?


00:49:34.828 --> 00:49:36.228
Fix-a-flat.


00:51:31.678 --> 00:51:33.558
Sticky tape...


00:52:01.720 --> 00:52:03.241
Okay...


00:52:42.204 --> 00:52:43.724
Okay. Okay.


00:52:45.764 --> 00:52:47.444
<i>-Tuva.
-Ida.</i>


00:52:47.484 --> 00:52:50.444
<i>Tuva, there was no jack in the car.
But I found a lever.</i>


00:52:50.484 --> 00:52:55.205
<i>I'll try using it to lift the rock.
Just get me out, it's freezing cold.</i>


00:53:09.926 --> 00:53:11.766
<i>-Did you change tanks?
-Yes.</i>


00:53:11.806 --> 00:53:14.606
<i>There's some left in my old tank.
This tank is almost full.</i>


00:53:14.646 --> 00:53:17.847
<i>Tuva, this is what we have.</i>


00:53:18.847 --> 00:53:22.127
<i>-We'll move the rock with it, Okay?
-Okay.</i>


00:53:22.167 --> 00:53:24.007
<i>Okay, just get me out.</i>


00:53:33.928 --> 00:53:34.928
<i>Okay.</i>


00:53:45.449 --> 00:53:48.209
<i>Ready, Tuva!
Push! Push!</i>


00:53:53.010 --> 00:53:55.290
<i>-Is it moving?
-No.</i>


00:53:57.930 --> 00:54:00.450
<i>-I'm using too much air.
-How much?</i>


00:54:00.490 --> 00:54:04.491
<i>-20 bars. Let's try one more time.
-Okay.</i>


00:54:11.051 --> 00:54:14.291
<i>Okay, Tuva.
One. Two.</i>


00:54:17.412 --> 00:54:18.852
<i>Again!</i>


00:54:23.572 --> 00:54:26.212
<i>Push, Tuva! Push!</i>


00:54:26.252 --> 00:54:29.133
<i>-Is it moving?
-Not a bit.</i>


00:54:32.893 --> 00:54:37.653
<i>Tuva, I need more time.
I have to switch to the other tank.</i>


00:55:03.136 --> 00:55:04.576
What's wrong?


00:55:11.376 --> 00:55:15.017
<i>-Damn it. The valve won't open.
-Is it stuck?</i>


00:55:16.017 --> 00:55:18.737
<i>I dropped the tank.</i>


00:55:18.777 --> 00:55:21.937
<i>I never checked the valve.
It must have broken.</i>


00:55:21.977 --> 00:55:26.377
<i>-Is it not moving?
-It's just spinning without resistance.</i>


00:55:27.298 --> 00:55:29.178
<i>Damn it!</i>


00:55:29.218 --> 00:55:32.658
<i>Breathe slowly.
How much air do you have?</i>


00:55:32.698 --> 00:55:37.538
<i>I have three,
maybe four minutes left.</i>


00:55:40.859 --> 00:55:44.739
<i>Okay, one more time with the lever.
Find a new spot.</i>


00:55:44.779 --> 00:55:46.099
<i>Okay.</i>


00:56:01.700 --> 00:56:04.741
<i>Ready, Tuva?
You have to push.</i>


00:56:06.021 --> 00:56:07.261
<i>Push!</i>


00:56:11.141 --> 00:56:14.581
<i>Again, come on!
Push, Tuva!</i>


00:56:18.022 --> 00:56:19.542
<i>No, no, no, no!</i>


00:56:20.182 --> 00:56:21.382
<i>Your BCD!</i>


00:56:22.902 --> 00:56:25.582
<i>Push it under the rock
and fill it with air.</i>


00:56:25.622 --> 00:56:28.783
<i>-I'm almost out of air!
-Don't talk. Just do it!</i>


00:56:49.264 --> 00:56:52.145
<i>-The safety valve is opening!
-Try to block it!</i>


00:56:52.185 --> 00:56:54.145
<i>I can't do it....</i>


00:56:54.185 --> 00:56:56.825
<i>Damn!
It doesn't work.</i>


00:56:56.865 --> 00:56:58.425
<i>Block it!</i>


00:57:01.625 --> 00:57:02.946
<i>I can't.</i>


00:57:27.148 --> 00:57:29.388
<i>I'm almost out of air.</i>


00:57:33.748 --> 00:57:35.428
<i>You have to choose.</i>


00:57:36.348 --> 00:57:38.108
<i>I can stay here...</i>


00:57:39.829 --> 00:57:41.749
<i>...and breathe from your air.</i>


00:57:41.789 --> 00:57:45.149
<i>Or I can do a free ascent.
Maybe someone...</i>


00:57:45.189 --> 00:57:47.189
<i>You can't do that.</i>


00:57:47.229 --> 00:57:50.269
<i>You can't do a free ascent.
You'll die.</i>


00:57:50.309 --> 00:57:55.550
<i>You have maybe 15 minutes left.
Help might come...</i>


00:57:55.590 --> 00:57:57.510
<i>No, Ida,
it's not going to happen.</i>


00:58:01.150 --> 00:58:03.671
<i>When your air is out</i>


00:58:03.711 --> 00:58:05.391
<i>you have to take mine...</i>


00:58:09.351 --> 00:58:13.711
<i>...so you can live.
Please, just stay until it's over.</i>


00:58:41.954 --> 00:58:43.354
<i>Zero.</i>


00:58:51.875 --> 00:58:53.195
<i>It's okay.</i>


00:58:55.435 --> 00:58:58.155
<i>I'm so sorry that mom
is not here with you.</i>


00:58:59.915 --> 00:59:02.075
<i>I want it to be you.</i>


01:00:03.761 --> 01:00:06.121
Take the air!


01:01:15.967 --> 01:01:17.927
Are you giving up too?


01:05:54.150 --> 01:05:56.070
You need to decompress.
You have too many dives in your system.


01:05:56.110 --> 01:05:59.150
-I'm sorry I left you.
-Ida, stop it!


01:05:59.190 --> 01:06:02.391
You've done too many ascents.
If you go to the surface now you'll die


01:06:02.431 --> 01:06:04.271
before we get you
to a pressure chamber.


01:06:04.311 --> 01:06:07.591
-How did you feel after your last ascent?
-Not so good.


01:06:07.631 --> 01:06:09.751
How do you feel now?
Any pain in your joints?


01:06:11.431 --> 01:06:13.071
In my shoulder and arm.


01:06:13.711 --> 01:06:16.792
You have to stay here
for 30 minutes at least.


01:06:21.872 --> 01:06:25.592
-That's all we have.
-Stay as long as you can.


01:06:25.632 --> 01:06:29.753
Then get to the surface.
I'll wait for you there and pull you out.


01:06:31.273 --> 01:06:33.953
Monitor yourself for CO2 poisoning.


01:06:33.993 --> 01:06:36.913
Count backwards or something.


01:06:36.953 --> 01:06:39.514
Okay, I'll see you up there.


01:06:42.034 --> 01:06:43.714
I'll see you soon.


01:07:40.679 --> 01:07:42.879
I can shuttle air from the surface.


01:07:46.639 --> 01:07:49.679
-It will give you a little extra time.
-Wait, wait!


01:07:50.720 --> 01:07:52.160
We have air!


01:07:52.200 --> 01:07:55.880
The broken air tank at the bottom,
it's almost full.


01:07:58.720 --> 01:08:01.560
We just need to break it open.


01:08:01.600 --> 01:08:03.001
In here, right?


01:08:05.841 --> 01:08:07.321
60 seconds!


01:08:19.602 --> 01:08:21.841
...four, five...


01:08:23.602 --> 01:08:25.761
...seven, eight...


01:09:25.087 --> 01:09:28.168
We have to do this now.
The air is getting bad here.


01:10:23.572 --> 01:10:25.172
We did it!


01:10:45.134 --> 01:10:46.414
Ida.


01:10:47.814 --> 01:10:49.014
Ida.


01:10:50.975 --> 01:10:52.255
Ida?


01:10:52.855 --> 01:10:54.375
Ida. Ida!


01:13:39.645 --> 01:13:44.645
Subtitles by explosiveskull

